{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidTwistFlip","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidTwistFlip","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidTwistFlip.twist_rotation_dihedral","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidTwistFlip.twist_rotation_dihedral","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidTwistFlip.lean#L64-L67","doc":"**Dihedral relation** `σ₁ α σ₁ = α⁻¹` (`= α²`): a reflection inverts the\nrotation, exhibiting `D₃ ≅ S₃`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidTwistFlip.rotation_pow_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidTwistFlip.rotation_pow_three","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidTwistFlip.lean#L60-L62","doc":"The rotation has order dividing 3: `α³ = id`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidTwistFlip.rotation_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidTwistFlip.rotation_apply","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidTwistFlip.lean#L58-L58","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidTwistFlip.rotation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidTwistFlip.rotation","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidTwistFlip.lean#L54-L56","doc":"The **rotation** `α = σ₁σ₂ : 𝐛 ↦ (b₂, b₀, b₁)` — the order-3 cyclic\npermutation of the three branches. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidTwistFlip.twist_flip_braid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidTwistFlip.twist_flip_braid","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidTwistFlip.lean#L49-L52","doc":"**Braid relation** `σ₁σ₂σ₁ = σ₂σ₁σ₂` — the defining relation of `B₃`,\nexhibiting `⟨σ₁,σ₂⟩ ≅ S₃`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidTwistFlip.flip_involutive","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidTwistFlip.flip_involutive","kind":"theorem","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidTwistFlip.lean#L46-L47","doc":"Flip is an involution: `σ₂² = id`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidTwistFlip.twist_involutive","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidTwistFlip.twist_involutive","kind":"theorem","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidTwistFlip.lean#L43-L44","doc":"Twist is an involution: `σ₁² = id`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidTwistFlip.flip","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidTwistFlip.flip","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidTwistFlip.lean#L39-L41","doc":"The **flip** generator `σ₂` — the reflection `(b₁ b₂)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidTwistFlip.twist","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidTwistFlip.twist","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidTwistFlip.lean#L35-L37","doc":"The **twist** generator `σ₁` — the reflection `(b₀ b₁)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidTwistFlip","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidTwistFlip","kind":"def","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidTwistFlip.lean#L27-L29","doc":"The three branches `𝐛 = (b₀, b₁, b₂)` of the cubic constraint — the carrier\non which the trefoil monodromy `S₃` acts. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:braid-twist-flip","label":"def:braid-twist-flip","md":"quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/braid-twist-flip.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}